			<Placemark id="0319D653143F3CB14DB3">
				<name>Freedom Monument</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div><b>The Freedom Monument</b> is one of Latvia’s strongest symbols of independence – a place where Riga’s heart beats especially loud.</div><div>In 2023, two world records were set at the foot of the monument during the World Athletics Road Running Championships Riga23. <b>The women’s road mile world record, 4:20.98, still stands today.</b></div>]]></description>
				<LookAt>
					<longitude>24.10286969201809</longitude>
					<latitude>56.94753289055387</latitude>
					<altitude>3.291261135461871</altitude>
